Subject: [PATCH] Disable undefined opcodes (after 0xbc) (#57)

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: cce2d2cbebcc8ed18b8bd840e71a8ae587b998f2
Recorded-replay-commit: 67285bc7bef2a4525c95019fa64e11729ce2a6d5

diff --git a/src/script/interpreter.cpp b/src/script/interpreter.cpp
index 0a18ae3e9b..e3912aa341 100644
--- a/src/script/interpreter.cpp
+++ b/src/script/interpreter.cpp
@@ -92,6 +92,9 @@ static bool IsOpcodeDisabled(opcodetype opcode, uint32_t flags) {
             return true;
 
         default:
+            // All undefined opcodes are also disabled.
+            if (opcode >= FIRST_UNDEFINED_OP_VALUE)
+                return true;
             break;
     }
 
